-- Universal Aimbot + ESP for Roblox (Delta compatible)
-- Toggle GUI: X collapses to a ball, click ball to restore.
-- Settings panel inside the GUI.
-- Aimbot locks onto enemy heads, has FOV slider, wall check & team check.
-- ESP draws boxes around enemies.

